  "notes": "Geometric for «وربك الغني ذو الرحمة», an hourglass for the generations that pass. 134 (the promised punishment): night sky, nothing drawn. STAGING v4: c1 (133): geometric for His names (133:1-4). The condition 133:5-12 (if He wills, He removes you) is not acted: nobody leaves there. On 133:13-18 (as He produced you from the offspring of another people; As-Sa'di: as those before you departed and left it to you) one group of people on the road at dusk turns to go (133:13) and leaves on 133:17, while another group walks in on 133:14, with the hourglass plate. c2 (134) stays ambient: the promised punishment (night sky, nothing drawn)."
